      "text": "检验鉴定",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0c304491",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "鉴定依据：【频谱检验报告RA1011-G】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4f91951d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "无明确共鸣时长和明确触发事件，主诉自幼对周遭环境表现出模糊的感应性。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c0083d19",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "对象声痕位置于额头中央，共鸣后原无明显体征变化，但随频率波动反噬，主诉的发梢和发尾出现局部的羽毛化表现。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_53810ff0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "对象能与周遭涌动的自然气流感应,具体表现为可感知暴露于气流中的信息、可汇聚气流形成有能量的场域。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7ae87fd7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "共鸣频率共性较强，频谱检测图与已知气流、小型雀鸟的频率波动区间均有超过20%的相似率，测试有较强的谐振反应，但同样与多个相已知的频谱检测图存在5%左右的相似率，推测为非单一共鸣源或共鸣源本身具有强发散性，无法完全确认共鸣源。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_868f3851",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "受试样本拉贝尔曲线呈稳定上升态，最终趋向稳定波动，检测结果判断为自然型共鸣者。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "共鸣能力"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aa6fa9a2",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "超频诊断报告",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_75e70039",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "受试样本波形检测图呈椭圆形波动，时域表示规律，未见异常波形。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_28959d1f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "诊断结果:超频临界值较低，稳定性较高，无超频风险。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8bdd7bd2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "存在过往超频史，最高等级:轻。超频时对象曾长期处于感知过载状态，间歇性共鸣能力失控导致超限度的信息接收和信息承载，虽未引发灾害性事件和其他人员伤亡，但致使主诉多次陷入昏厥。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c56e92f3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "诊断原因为心因性负荷过重，引发自身频率波动，造成易感性上升和能力反噬。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0f191285",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "超频后遗症为发梢和发尾的不可逆羽毛化表现，羽毛化范围和位置固定，未有进一步扩散。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0189fb0d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "当前对象感知能力已恢复可控，综合状态趋于稳定，未见复发倾向，按时进行定期检查即可。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "超频诊断报告"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}